# --- Recordings, datasets, model artefacts (manifest-tracked, never committed) ---
data/**
!data/README.md
!data/manifests/
!data/manifests/README.md
!data/manifests/*.json
!data/manifests/*.exclusions.jsonl
# Phase 07: frozen participant-level split files ARE tracked - Phases 09-19 must use the same
# folds, so they belong in the repository beside the manifests (README section 13). Labels,
# reference tracks and self-test manifests are not: they are regenerable from raw + manifest.
!data/splits/
!data/splits/**/
!data/splits/**/*.json
data/manifests/*selftest*
data/splits/*selftest*/
experiments/**
!experiments/README.md
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.mp4
*.avi
