# --- Model assets (Phase 03 gate C-03-5: MANIFEST-ONLY) ---
# The pinned MediaPipe task file is re-fetched by scripts/fetch_hand_landmarker_model.py; only the
# manifest (asset id, versioned URL, SHA-256) is tracked. assets/samples/ (Phase 04) decides separately.
assets/models/*.task
